  "description": "Replacement of existing double-glazed white uPVC casement windows on the front, courtyard and flank elevations, proposed to be replaced with double glazed uPVC windows. The uPVC windows will be installed to replace the existing top hung and bottom hung casement windows.\nThe uPVC top-hung casement openings with obscure glazing will be replaced with uPVC top-hung casement windows.  \nThe inward uPVC bottom hung casement windows will be replaced with Tilt and turn windows that match the appearance of the existing. \nThe Oriel window designs will also be retained with the frames constructed using uPVC. All replacement windows will retain double glazing, the obscure glass will remain, with all frames finished in white. Existing Timber doors are to remain.\nChanges will achieve a like for like appearance.\n",
